        <activityName xml:lang="en">Silicone plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Silicone plant
Average of two plants. Chemical production since more than 100 years. Life time estimated to be 100a. Annual production 1 Mio. tonnes.;
UUID: f90d4e0c-9d60-3196-8160-7b1a1df86ffb
Inventory for the production plant including land use, machinery and buildings.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Chemical production facility.
Time period: Reporting time of environmental reports.
Production volume: Normalized for a production capacity of 1 000 000t/a.
Sampling: Environmental reports and webpage. 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f90d4e0c-9d60-3196-8160-7b1a1df86ffb.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
